to get around the laws that protect

141
00:05:05,553 --> 00:05:08,633
sailors' wages and working conditions.

142
00:05:09,193 --> 00:05:10,140
Panama,

143
00:05:10,140 --> 00:05:11,329
for example,

144
00:05:11,329 --> 00:05:14,242
offers registration online and lets owners

145
00:05:14,242 --> 00:05:16,784
hire low-cost crews from anywhere.

146
00:05:17,050 --> 00:05:20,340
And it works at an enormous scale.

147
00:05:20,440 --> 00:05:21,883
In twenty twenty-six,

148
00:05:21,883 --> 00:05:24,184
Liberia became the first registry in

149
00:05:24,184 --> 00:05:27,070
history to pass 300 million tons of

150
00:05:27,070 --> 00:05:27,467
ships,

