176
00:06:21,617 --> 00:06:22,437
Cheaper,

177
00:06:22,437 --> 00:06:23,256
simpler,

178
00:06:23,256 --> 00:06:24,987
lighter rules.

179
00:06:25,227 --> 00:06:27,543
But when something goes wrong far out

180
00:06:27,543 --> 00:06:28,289
