243
00:08:45,950 --> 00:08:49,390
So why doesn't the world simply ban

244
00:08:49,390 --> 00:08:50,421
it?

245
00:08:56,083 --> 00:08:58,543
If flags of convenience cause so many

246
00:08:58,543 --> 00:08:59,257
problems,

247
00:08:59,257 --> 00:09:01,333
